From 2d32e008f275587e1e4c288d9f503321c85da0aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yanghao <yeqiangmao@contributor>


Date: Mon, 29 Dec 2025 15:20:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] USERSTORY Statement Outline Description: MySQL on
 Dstore does not support the Statement Outline feature and needs to backport
 this functionality from RDS. SQL execution plans are sometimes unstable and
 dependent on physical IBD file. To keep a stable performance and execution
 plan; fixed optimizer or index hint should be applied; By calling
 dbms_outln.XXX storage procedure added in this feature, outline hints can be
 bound to SQLs with certain DIGEST patterns w/o correcting client's SQL.

Implementation:
Define dbms_outln.XXX APIs to add/delete/view optimizer and index hints applied to certain digest. super user or root can call these APIs;In parser step, this additional hints are applied to SQLs;
